<titlePage type="main"><docTitle><titlePart type="main"><hi rendition="#b">Phaëthon</hi></titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<byline>von<lb/>
<docAuthor>F. W. Waiblinger.</docAuthor></byline><lb/>
